This directory holds files copied into the project when the addon is selected.

Anything here is copied verbatim, preserving subdirectories. For example:
  templates/_addons/<id>/files/.github/workflows/ci.yml
  -> <project>/.github/workflows/ci.yml

Delete this .keep file once you add real files. (This _template directory is
scaffolding and is never offered as a real addon, so nothing here is loaded.)
